# Runbook · start a local test server
Three steps with verification and rollback. Open it in the Mission view: each step can be checked off and the state is saved in the browser.

// profile: lnd-1.1 · scope: example · suggested_views: mision, web

---

@action a-1
order: 1
title: Create a working folder
duration: 1 min
verification: the folder exists and is empty
rollback: delete the folder

```
mkdir -p ~/lnd-demo && cd ~/lnd-demo
```
@@

@action a-2
order: 2
title: Copy the renderer and an example
depends_on: a-1
duration: 1 min
verification: both files are in the folder

```
cp renderer/render.html examples/en/hello.lnd ~/lnd-demo/
```
@@

@action a-3
order: 3
title: Serve the folder on localhost
depends_on: a-2
duration: 1 min
verification: the page opens and the console shows no errors
rollback: stop the server with Ctrl C

```
python3 -m http.server 8000 --bind 127.0.0.1
```
@@
